Scoped yaepblur edge-preserving blur filter

The summed-area window sums (pre_calculate_row, pre_calculate_col), the
clipped window, the integer mean/variance blend
(sigma*mean + var*src)/(sigma+var) of filter_slice, the radius clipping of
config_input, the unselected-plane copy of filter_frame, the pix_fmts list and
the radius/r, planes/p and sigma/s options in src/video-ops/yaepblur.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_yaepblur.c, with the AV_OPT_TYPE_INT expression, range and
rounding semantics of libavutil/opt.c (set_string_number, write_number).
